      "label": "(3)",
      "text": "At least one visual alarm signal shall be provided that identiﬁes the speciﬁc alarm condition and its priority. This signal shall be perceived correctly (be legible) at a distance of 1 m from the equipment or part of the equipment or from the clinician’s position. 55 (IEC 60601-1-8 2.3.1)",
